{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e6e2c9567a6f5c6f","name":"Rogue Squadron","source":{"id":"source:reference-e6e2c9567a6f5c6f","title":"Rogue Squadron","revision":20293,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:34:45Z","sha256":"02fe8c3efc6e60e8fd3d59ed056e1e2b3e4cbdc4d1a2c34f0ec63b57adb4b4d1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20293","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rogue%20Squadron&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e6e2c9567a6f5c6f","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Description"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The heroic exploits of Rogue Squadron become legendary during the the Galactic Civil War and the days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},". Some pilots remain members of the squadron for extended periods, while others rotate in and out at the determination of the squadron leader. Rogue Squadron members are excellent pilots, but they typically have other combat and related skills, enabling them to carry out orders and assignments not usually given to a fighter squadron.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Legacy Era"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Rogue Squadron remains the best of all squadrons in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},", the elite of the elite. It has been in continuous operation since its formation by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},". Though their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," of choice has changed over the years, their elite combat skills and dedication has not. Rogue Squadron currently flies the ",{"tag":"a","children":["CF9 Crossfire Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CF9_Crossfire_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:51fafbe3529f350f"}," and is stationed aboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Indomitable"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Indomitable","referenceId":"reference:912330aa12779c40"}," until the ship's destruction, after which the legendary relocates to Admiral Stazi's new flagship, The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Alliance"]}," (an ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Imperious"]},"-Class Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperious-Class_Star_Destroyer","referenceId":"reference:4d9dbcd2efb9d38d"},"). Squadron personnel are as diverse as ever, representing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," from across the galaxy. No matter their origin, all are excellent pilots and bold fighters. Their personalities are just as diverse as their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},", and while they are dedicated to The Galactic Alliance cause, it doesn't mean they always get along with each other.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As with previous incarnations of the squadron, members are expected to fulfill a variety of roles beyond ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," combat. As an elite force, they are deployed in commando raids and special operations, usually with the squadron itself fulfilling the role of attacker or close support. Their successful operations include the theft of the prototype ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Imperious"]},"-Class Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperious-Class_Star_Destroyer","referenceId":"reference:4d9dbcd2efb9d38d"},", and the \"rescue\" of Admiral Stazi from the doomed ",{"tag":"i","children":["Indomitable"]},".\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Rogue Squadron Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rogue Squadron Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rogue_Squadron_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:97ef0b499b37dce0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Anj Dahl"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Anj_Dahl","referenceId":"reference:3a327c146998c6ef"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Derek Klivian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Derek_Klivian","referenceId":"refer